{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>בפתחי</b> — on account of those going out and coming in." "<b>בעיר אמריה</b> — its mem is missing, or say בצרי in place of פתח, and the meaning is: or in the city say its mem is missing, as when the gates are not open."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {1 "The comment is textually difficult; read hyper-literally. The argument apparently involves both a missing mem and a possible substitution of בצרי for פתח, but the syntax of the Hebrew as transmitted is opaque."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:48.469719169Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}